et to add BAD STUDENT LOVE to your wishlist!Please note: This broadcast features pre-recorded gameplay footage played on a continuous loop.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:45:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691191","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4532830-1846651706690524","game_id":"steam-4532830","kind":"update","title":"BAD STUDENT LOVE Demo v0.1.11 Patch Notes","summary":"BAD STUDENT LOVE Demo v0.1.11 Patch NotesA Brand-New Opening & Major Demo Improvements!Hello everyone! This is the BAD STUDENT LOVE development team.Demo version v0.1.11 is now live!In this update, we've introduced a brand-new opening, significantly improved CG video quality, added new CG animations to Jeong Haeun's events, and enhanced UI readability across multiple languages.We've also made major improvements to character presentation and story content to deliver a more immersive and enjoyable","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:31:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690524","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4532830-1845383656395525","game_id":"steam-4532830","kind":"update","title":"Demo v0.1.10 Update: Now Supporting Indonesian! (+ Bug Fixes)","summary":"BAD STUDENT LOVE Demo v0.1.10 Patch NotesNow Supporting Indonesian!Hello everyone! This is the BAD STUDENT LOVE development team.Demo version v0.1.10 is now live! In this update, we have added Indonesian language support, fixed several text and visual issues, adjusted monologue lines based on affection points, and refreshed the title screen.🌐 New Language SupportAdded Indonesian LanguageIndonesian has been newly added to the language options. Players can now enjoy the demo localized in Indonesia","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T07:38:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395525","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4532830-1844115010492377","game_id":"steam-4532830","kind":"update","title":"BAD STUDENT LOVE Demo v0.1.8 Patch Notes","summary":"BAD STUDENT LOVE Demo v0.1.8 Patch NotesHello everyone! This is the BAD STUDENT LOVE development team.Demo version v1.0.8 is now live! This update focuses on improving the Save/Load and Gallery interfaces, making video playback more convenient, and optimizing the overall game size.💾 Save / Load UI ImprovementsImproved Save / Load InterfaceThe Save/Load screen has been redesigned with larger and wider save slots for improved readability and usability.More Detailed Save InformationNewly created sa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T15:04:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010492377","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4532830-1843481262700677","game_id":"steam-4532830","kind":"update","title":"BAD STUDENT LOVE Demo v0.1.7 Patch Notes","summary":"BAD STUDENT LOVE Demo v0.1.7 Patch NotesHello everyone! This is the BAD STUDENT LOVE development team.Demo version v1.0.7 is now live! In this update, we have introduced a new visual map navigation system, added intuitive affection feedback for choices, implemented interactive sound effects, and fixed dialogue portrait issues.⚠️ Notice Regarding Existing Save Files:Due to a major overhaul of the map event selection system in this patch, save files created on the Map Screen in previous versions m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T04:09:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700677","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4532830-1843481262690154","game_id":"steam-4532830","kind":"update","title":"BAD STUDENT LOVE Demo v0.1.6 Patch Notes","summary":"BAD STUDENT LOVE Demo v0.1.6 Patch NotesHello everyone! This is the BAD STUDENT LOVE development team.Demo version v0.1.6 is now live! In this update, we’ve focused on improving player convenience, adding quality-of-life UI features, enhancing audio/visual assets, and addressing known bugs.⚠️ Notice Regarding Existing Save Files:If you load an existing save file from an earlier version, you will be able to access the renewed Dialogue Box and Affection Level UI starting from the next event/scene ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T18:46:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690154","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4532830-1842212951306794","game_id":"steam-4532830","kind":"announcement","title":"〈BAD STUDENT LOVE〉 Playable Demo Now Available!","summary":"\\ 〈BAD STUDENT LOVE〉 Playable Demo Release & OverviewHello, I am the solo developer behind 〈BAD STUDENT LOVE〉.Even though it has only been a few days since the demo was released, so many of you have downloaded it and immersed yourselves deeply in the story. I truly appreciate your support.■ Demo Content & PlaytimeAvailable Content: You can experience the entire story of the first month out of the full game's 3-month summer timeline.Estimated Playtime: Approximately 2 hours on average. Despite be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T01:57:43Z","time_precision":"